{"at": "2026-10-04T00:37:34", "model": "openai/gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "input_head": "Notes so far: They have been traveling a lot lately, focusing on the last 3 months of domestic trips within the US, incl", "raw": "{\"summary\": \"User has been traveling a lot lately, focusing on the last 3 months of domestic trips within the US, including Miami (January 12th - 17th), Chicago (February 10th), New York City (February 17th - 20th), and Los Angeles (March 1st - 3rd). They are trying to get a better handle on their snacking habits and asked for help tracking their daily calorie intake and suggesting healthier alternatives to their go-to convenience snacks. They enjoy a weekly ritual of sour cream and onion chips at 3 pm and also tend to grab a bag of pretzels or a Slim Jim around 5-6 pm, estimating these snacks to be around 200-300 calories each. User is trying to cut down on sugar and is excited to start making changes to their snacking habits. They are also interested in recipes for oven-roasted sweet potato fries and plan to try the Spicy Korean-Style variation. User is looking for tips on displaying their homemade jam at the next market event, having sold out quickly at the weekly farmers' market on Saturday, March 12th. They are considering using a tiered stand and asked for suggestions on tablecloths that would complement their jam labels, deciding on sunflowers for their display. User is thinking of offering a BOGO promotion to attract more customers and asked for tips on effectively promoting the offer at their stand. User has shown interest in gut health and asked for recommendations on books related to improving digestive health. User inquired about grooming needs for a long-haired rabbit, learning that daily brushing is essential to prevent matting. They asked about trimming fur and were advised against using scissors, suggesting specific rabbit trimmers instead. User has a Toyota Camry and recently got it serviced at the dealership about three weeks ago. They are looking for car air freshener recommendations and are currently using lavender or vanilla scents but are open to trying something new, considering Citrus Burst or Mint to Be. User has a CalTrend NeoSupreme car cover, which has been working great in reducing dust accumulation, and is looking for microfiber cloths to clean their car's interior and exterior. User loves hearing saxophones in pop songs and is excited to listen to modern pop songs featuring the saxophone. They are learning to play the saxophone and asked for tips for a beginner. User expressed interest in cooking and shared a recipe for seafood laksa, a spicy soup made with seafood, coconut milk, and noodles, and asked about variations and tips for making it vegetarian or vegan. User is proficient in Hebrew and expressed a desire to communicate in transliterated Hebrew. User has been exploring the similarities and differences between Tchaikovsky and Prokofiev, noting that Prokofiev's Romeo and Juliet sounded quite Tchaikovsky to them, particularly in orchestration and romantic atmosphere. They have been listening to Tchaikovsky's art songs and find them less classical than his ballet music. User is curious about the influence of Tchaikovsky on Prokofiev's interest in ballet music and is also interested in the similarities and differences between Mahler and Shostakovich. They recognize that Bartok used European folk music, while Debussy and Dvorak incorporated music from distant cultures, and are looking for other composers who employed foreign music in their compositions. User has been experimenting with mixology for a few weeks, particularly with spicy flavors in cocktails. They made a Spicy Mango Mule with a splash of smoky mezcal that was a huge hit at their last BBQ. User is trying to recreate the Paper Plane cocktail, made with bourbon, Aperol, and Amaro Nonino, and is considering using chocolate mole bitters to change the flavor profile. They are interested in recommendations for experimenting with unusual bitters in cocktails. User is planning to do some grocery shopping at Target this weekend and asked for help finding deals on laundry detergent, noting that the usual price of a pack of Tide laundry detergent at Target is $12.99. They also inquired about sales on household essentials like dish soap and toilet paper, and asked about discounts on Gain dish soap, Crest toothpaste, and marinara sauce, mentioning they have coupons for $2 off Gain dish soap and 50 cents off Crest toothpaste, as well as an Ibotta offer on marinara sauce. User is planning a trip to visit their mom's best friend in San Francisco, who has been diagnosed with terminal cancer, and is flexible with travel dates, preferring to fly out of JFK or LaGuardia. They have booked a flight with American Airlines and accommodations at Hotel Zeppelin. They are sending a care package to their mom's best friend with a Boll & Branch Soft Fleece Blanket. User expressed interest in how Capitol Records supports emerging artists in the music industry, appreciating their focus on unique sounds and long-term success rather than just short-term gains. User is planning to organize a charity walk similar to the \"\n\n,\"Walk for Hunger\"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            