dration, and planning to start training earlier to build endurance and speed. User is considering finding a running buddy or joining a running group for motivation and accountability. They are seeking tips on staying motivated and avoiding burnout during training. User is thinking of selling their sculptures online and is looking for pricing strategies. They plan to start with a price point of $75 for their clay bird sculpture and are considering offering a discount for their first sale. User is also planning to offer a bundle deal for an art fair next month, pricing it at $159 for a set of three small sculptures, including the clay bird. They have been experimenting with different sculpting techniques at home, particularly glazing techniques and color combinations, and are excited about a new ceramic vase they are creating. User plans to share their new vase on social media and at the art fair, possibly through an Instagram story or Facebook live video. They are considering offering custom commissions and are contemplating whether to create a separate page for this on their website or social media profiles. User has been getting back into non-fiction books and has been listening to audiobooks during their commute. They started \"\n\n,\"The Girl on the Train\"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                