{"at": "2026-10-04T00:40:21", "model": "openai/gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "input_head": "Notes so far: They have been traveling a lot lately, focusing on the last 3 months of domestic trips within the US, incl", "raw": "{\"summary\": \"User has been traveling a lot lately, focusing on the last 3 months of domestic trips within the US, including Miami (January 12th - 17th), Chicago (February 10th), New York City (February 17th - 20th), and Los Angeles (March 1st - 3rd). They are trying to get a better handle on their snacking habits and asked for help tracking their daily calorie intake and suggesting healthier alternatives to their go-to convenience snacks. They enjoy a weekly ritual of sour cream and onion chips at 3 pm and also tend to grab a bag of pretzels or a Slim Jim around 5-6 pm, estimating these snacks to be around 200-300 calories each. User is trying to cut down on sugar and is excited to start making changes to their snacking habits. They are also interested in recipes for oven-roasted sweet potato fries and plan to try the Spicy Korean-Style variation. User is looking for tips on displaying their homemade jam at the next market event, having sold out quickly at the weekly farmers' market on Saturday, March 12th. They are considering using a tiered stand and asked for suggestions on tablecloths that would complement their jam labels, deciding on sunflowers for their display. User is thinking of offering a BOGO promotion to attract more customers and asked for tips on effectively promoting the offer at their stand. User has shown interest in gut health and asked for recommendations on books related to improving digestive health. User inquired about grooming needs for a long-haired rabbit, learning that daily brushing is essential to prevent matting. They asked about trimming fur and were advised against using scissors, suggesting specific rabbit trimmers instead. User has a Toyota Camry and recently got it serviced at the dealership about three weeks ago. 