ing with unusual bitters in cocktails. User is planning to do some grocery shopping at Target this weekend and asked for help finding deals on laundry detergent, noting that the usual price of a pack of Tide laundry detergent at Target is $12.99. They also inquired about sales on household essentials like dish soap and toilet paper, and asked about discounts on Gain dish soap, Crest toothpaste, and marinara sauce, mentioning they have coupons for $2 off Gain dish soap and 50 cents off Crest toothpaste, as well as an Ibotta offer on marinara sauce. User is planning a trip to visit their mom's best friend in San Francisco, who has been diagnosed with terminal cancer, and is flexible with travel dates, preferring to fly out of JFK or LaGuardia. They have booked a flight with American Airlines and accommodations at Hotel Zeppelin. They are sending a care package to their mom's best friend with a Boll & Branch Soft Fleece Blanket. User expressed interest in how Capitol Records supports emerging artists in the music industry, appreciating their focus on unique sounds and long-term success rather than just short-term gains. User is planning to organize a charity walk similar to the \"\n\n,\"Walk for Hunger\"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                            