nd depression over the past few months, affecting their productivity. They are working on creating a manageable to-do list and prioritizing tasks. User is focusing on self-compassion and celebrating small victories, acknowledging that some days will be tougher than others. They plan to start journaling to track progress and express gratitude, and they are considering reaching out to a close friend to be their accountability buddy for support. User participated in the \"\n\n,\"Run for Hunger\"                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                                               