{"at": "2026-10-04T01:08:40", "model": "openai/gpt-4o-mini-2024-07-18", "input_head": "Notes so far: User is tracking their summer concert schedule and has tickets for the following shows: July 17th - Jonas ", "raw": "{\"summary\": \"User is tracking their summer concert schedule and has tickets for the following shows: July 17th - Jonas Brothers at TD Garden, August 20th - The Lumineers at House of Blues. They attended an Imagine Dragons concert on June 15th at Xfinity Center and enjoyed the energy of the lead singer. User is considering volunteering at music festivals and is open to traveling within a few hours of Boston. They have researched three festivals: XPoNential Music Festival (July 26-28 in Camden, NJ), Green River Festival (July 12-14 in Greenfield, MA), and Levitate Music and Arts Festival (dates TBD). For XPoNential, the volunteer application requires an online form, and roles include stagehands and artist hospitality, with perks like a free 3-day pass and meals. The atmosphere is relaxed and family-friendly, featuring indie, rock, and folk music. The Green River Festival has a similar application process, with roles in ticketing and concessions, and offers a free 3-day pass but no meals. User is looking for more information on Levitate's volunteer opportunities, roles, and perks. User has watched some Studio Ghibli films and finds them unique and thought-provoking. They are curious about the significance of Studio Ghibli in Japanese animation and the factors that contributed to the eventual success of some films that were not well received initially in Japan. User appreciates Studio Ghibli's ability to convey important social issues through animation and hopes more studios will create thought-provoking films that challenge societal norms. User is involved with Chattanooga Hockey, an inline hockey league that has been around since 2002, with over 150 participants (100 adults and 50 youth). The league operates as a 501(c)(3) non-profit and is run by a board of volunteers. They aim to encourage participation, develop character, advocate sportsmanship, and promote community engagement. The league is located in Chattanooga, which is a prime location a few hours from Atlanta, Nashville, and Asheville, and inline hockey is becoming more popular across the country. User is learning about Linux and has engaged in discussions about various Linux commands, their functions, and text editors. They have practiced commands like pwd, cd, ls, mkdir, touch, rm, mv, cp, echo, and cat, and are interested in more questions related to Linux. User inquired about exercising with asthma and was informed that it is safe to do so with precautions, such as using an inhaler and warming up properly. They also asked for tips to improve their skiing technique, specifically regarding flexion, and received advice on posture, dynamic and static flexion practice, and the option of taking ski lessons. User expressed interest in the latest technological advancements in medical science, including 3D printing, precision medicine, AI and machine learning, gene editing, immunotherapy, and digital health. They are aware of potential risks and ethical concerns associated with these advancements, such as data privacy, bias, lack of transparency, moral dilemmas, and cost, and hope that policymakers and medical professionals are taking these issues seriously. User has shown interest in various books, including \" \n        , \"Guns, Germs, and Steel,\" \n        \t: \"Powerful Patriots: Nationalist Protest in China’s Foreign Relations,\" \n        , \"The Wealth of Nations,\" \n        \t: \"Starry Messenger: Cosmic Perspectives on Civilization.\" \n        \t, \"Guns, Germs, and Steel\" \n        \t: \t-1.5, \t\"Powerful Patriots\" \n        \t: \t-1.5, \t\"The Wealth of Nations\" \n        \t: \t-1.5, \t\"Starry Messenger\" \n        \t: \t-1.5, \t\"Starry Messenger\" \n        \t: \t-1.5, \t\"Starry Messenger\" \n        \t: \t-1.5, \t\"Starry Messenger\"