der, both on their computer and on Spotify, and is looking for tips on organizing their library and finding new music. They enjoyed last Monday's Discover Weekly playlist and saved around 10 songs from it. User is exploring more of Lucy Dacus' discography and is interested in recommendations for popular tracks or albums. They are also interested in exploring more music from Phoebe Bridgers and Julien Baker. User has shown interest in stock trading and has asked about different types of stock orders, including market orders, limit orders, stop orders, stop limit orders, trailing stop orders, and after-hours trading orders. They are curious about the risks associated with after-hours trading and how it differs from regular trading hours. User is interested in the historical operations and tactics of the Gestapo, how they changed over time, and the factors influencing these changes. They are curious about how the Gestapo rationalized their brutal tactics and the role of propaganda in dehumanizing victims. User finds it difficult to understand how propaganda can influence people to commit terrible acts and is concerned about the potential for similar manipulation in today's world. User recently watched \"\n\n, \"The Sixth Sense,\"  \t\t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t: \t\"Oldboy\" \t, \t\"Oldboy\" \t